	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『デジモンアドベンチャー』より、アニメ設定を元に立体化したFigure-rise Standardシリーズとして「メタルガルルモン」が第2弾で登場！",
			"• 各関節パーツが広範囲に可動。劇中の様々なアクションポーズが再現できる。",
			"• 特徴的な「ビームウイング」のエフェクトは取り外し可能なPETシートで再現。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Digimon Adventure\", \"Metal Garurumon\" appears in the second installment of the Figure-rise Standard series, which is three-dimensional based on the anime setting!",
			"• Each joint part can move over a wide range. Various action poses from the movie can be reproduced.",
			"• The characteristic \"beam wing\" effect is reproduced with a removable PET sheet."
		]
